// Keep the full authored x=-300..300 front-to-rear corridor readable: initial pressure lives
// in the side lanes instead of standing on the player's strongest navigation/sightline axis.
// Closing Crew removes one member of each mirrored pressure pair so Easy keeps every signature
// threat type while avoiding the Normal/Hard crossfire density during polish sign-off.
// The easy-side inner Self-Checkout now starts west of the shelf line rather than inside the
// permanent center corridor. The three Normal/Hard-only actors remain in a second east-side ring
// behind shelf geometry and use the UDMF ambush flag, so front-lane gunfire cannot wake them
// before visual contact. This keeps escalation movement-driven and readable.
thing { x = -560.0; y = -170.0; angle = 0;   type = 17001; skill1 = true;  skill2 = true;  skill3 = true; skill4 = true; skill5 = true; single = true; coop = true; }
